# EXCEPTION: small manuscript figure data is intentionally versioned
# so Figures 3–5 can be reproduced from source alone (~1 MB total)
!manuscript/
!manuscript/analysis/
!manuscript/analysis/**
!manuscript/figs/
!manuscript/figs/*.pdf

# EXCEPTION: supplementary experiment summaries (small CSVs/JSONs, not raw results)
!supplementary/
